{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"vol-header","type":"text","x":-40,"y":-360,"width":2380,"height":220,"text":"# 条件异方差：从条件方差到可检验的波动预测\n\n**连续阅读：** [[01_Math/06_时间序列分析/04_ARCH-GARCH#ARCH/GARCH：从条件方差到可检验的波动预测|打开课程路径]]\n\n从上到下读：基础对象 → 模型与存在条件 → 发现平方依赖 → 估计与诊断 → 预测与稳定性 → 不对称及解释边界。26 个本主题原子复用 4 个共享原子；箭头只保留会改变理解或操作顺序的关系。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"group-foundations","type":"group","x":-40,"y":-60,"width":2380,"height":240,"label":"1 · 基础对象：先分清条件方差、条件异方差、聚集与标准化冲击","color":"6"},
		{"id":"shared-condvar","type":"text","x":400,"y":0,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[条件方差]]\n\n给定信息后，围绕条件均值仍剩多少二阶不确定性。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"vol-025","type":"text","x":800,"y":0,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[条件异方差]]\n\n条件方差随已知信息状态变化，而非固定常数。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"shared-cluster","type":"text","x":1600,"y":0,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[波动率聚集]]\n\n方向相关可很弱，绝对值或平方却持续相关。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"vol-001","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[条件尺度与标准化冲击|尺度 × 标准化冲击]]\n\nεₜ=√hₜ zₜ；创新、方差与标准化冲击不能混称。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"shared-whitenoise","type":"text","x":1200,"y":0,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[白噪声二阶定义|二阶白噪声]]\n\n不相关不等于 iid，也不排除条件异方差。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"group-models","type":"group","x":-40,"y":220,"width":2380,"height":240,"label":"2 · 模型与存在条件：递推、正性、严平稳和有限矩回答不同问题","color":"4"},
		{"id":"vol-002","type":"text","x":0,"y":280,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[ARCH(q)模型|ARCH(q)]]\n\n过去 q 期平方创新直接更新当前条件方差。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"vol-003","type":"text","x":400,"y":280,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[GARCH(p,q)模型|GARCH(p,q)]]\n\n加入过去方差，用低阶递推汇总更久的冲击。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"vol-004","type":"text","x":800,"y":280,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[ARCH-GARCH正性条件|正性条件]]\n\n非负系数是线性模型常用充分条件，不是平稳条件。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"vol-005","type":"text","x":1200,"y":280,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[GARCH严格平稳条件|严格平稳]]\n\nGARCH(1,1) 看随机系数的 log-moment 是否收缩。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"vol-006","type":"text","x":1600,"y":280,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[GARCH有限方差条件|有限无条件方差]]\n\n标准化 GARCH(1,1) 要求 α+β<1。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"vol-007","type":"text","x":2000,"y":280,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[GARCH参数持久性|反应、延续与持久性]]\n\nα 看新冲击，β 看旧方差，α+β 看二阶缺口衰减。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"group-detection","type":"group","x":-40,"y":500,"width":2380,"height":240,"label":"3 · 发现平方依赖：原残差合格，不代表条件方差已经处理","color":"1"},
		{"id":"vol-008","type":"text","x":400,"y":560,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[平方创新ARMA表示|平方创新的 ARMA 型表示]]\n\n解释原创新不相关而平方创新持续相关。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"vol-009","type":"text","x":1600,"y":560,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[ARCH-LM检验|ARCH-LM]]\n\n平方残差辅助回归检验预先选择的 ARCH 滞后。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"vol-010","type":"text","x":1000,"y":560,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[McLeod-Li检验|McLeod–Li]]\n\n联合检查平方残差自相关，并说明矩与实现边界。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"group-estimation","type":"group","x":-40,"y":780,"width":2380,"height":240,"label":"4 · 估计与诊断：分布、初值、稳健推断和双层残差检查缺一不可","color":"3"},
		{"id":"vol-011","type":"text","x":600,"y":840,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[GARCH条件似然|条件似然与初值]]\n\n密度、有效样本与 presample 处理共同决定目标。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"vol-012","type":"text","x":200,"y":840,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[Gaussian QMLE]]\n\n条件矩正确时可容忍非正态，但推断需稳健协方差。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"vol-013","type":"text","x":1000,"y":840,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[Student-t GARCH标准化|标准化 Student-t]]\n\n只有 E(z²)=1 时，h 才继续表示条件方差。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"vol-014","type":"text","x":1400,"y":840,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[GARCH残差双层诊断|标准化残差双层诊断]]\n\nẑ 查均值遗漏，ẑ² 查剩余方差动态。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"vol-015","type":"text","x":1800,"y":840,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[GARCH选择与预测评估|模型比较与预测评价]]\n\n同一响应与样本上的可比完整 likelihood 可比较不同均值、方差和分布候选；保序损失负责预测选择。","color":"2"},
		{"id":"group-forecast","type":"group","x":-40,"y":1060,"width":2380,"height":240,"label":"5 · 预测与稳定性：先守住一步索引，再解释多步回归和高持久性","color":"2"},
		{"id":"vol-016","type":"text","x":200,"y":1120,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[GARCH一步方差预测|一步方差预测]]\n\nhₜ₊₁|ₜ 使用刚观察到的 εₜ²，不能落后一格。","color":"2"},
		{"id":"vol-017","type":"text","x":600,"y":1120,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[GARCH多步方差预测|多步预测与半衰期]]\n\n回归长期方差的是期望缺口，不是实现路径保证。","color":"2"},
		{"id":"vol-018","type":"text","x":1000,"y":1120,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[IGARCH平稳与矩边界|IGARCH 边界]]\n\nα+β=1 排除有限长期方差，却未必排除严平稳。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"vol-019","type":"text","x":1400,"y":1120,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[方差断点伪GARCH持久性|断点伪装成高持久性]]\n\n制度切换可能被固定参数 GARCH 当成缓慢衰减。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"shared-rolling","type":"text","x":1800,"y":1120,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[滚动起点评估]]\n\n每个历史起点只用当时信息，test 留到选择结束。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"group-extensions","type":"group","x":-40,"y":1340,"width":2380,"height":240,"label":"6 · 不对称与解释边界：扩展模型增加表达力，也增加命名和因果风险","color":"5"},
		{"id":"vol-020","type":"text","x":0,"y":1400,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[波动不对称与杠杆|不对称 ≠ 杠杆因果]]\n\n符号相关预测关系不自动证明资本结构机制。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"vol-021","type":"text","x":400,"y":1400,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[GJR-GARCH模型|GJR-GARCH]]\n\n用冲击符号改变平方项对条件方差的作用。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"vol-026","type":"text","x":800,"y":1400,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[TARCH命名边界|TARCH 命名边界]]\n\n同一标签可能指方差递推，也可能指标准差递推。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"vol-022","type":"text","x":1200,"y":1400,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[EGARCH模型|EGARCH]]\n\n中心化幅度与有符号冲击共同递推 log variance。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"vol-023","type":"text","x":1600,"y":1400,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[ARCH-M风险溢价边界|ARCH-M 风险溢价边界]]\n\n风险量进入均值，不代表系数被定义为正。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"vol-024","type":"text","x":2000,"y":1400,"width":340,"height":150,"text":"## [[GARCH-X因果边界|GARCH-X 因果边界]]\n\n方差协变量描述条件关联，不能单独识别因果。","color":"5"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"edge-01","fromNode":"shared-condvar","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-025","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"随信息状态变化时"},
		{"id":"edge-03","fromNode":"vol-002","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-003","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"再加入方差自身的滞后"},
		{"id":"edge-04","fromNode":"vol-003","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-004","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"先保证每条路径上方差合法"},
		{"id":"edge-05","fromNode":"vol-004","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-005","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"正性之后另查分布收缩"},
		{"id":"edge-06","fromNode":"vol-005","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-006","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"再问二阶矩是否有限"},
		{"id":"edge-07","fromNode":"vol-006","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-007","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"有限二阶矩下解释 α+β"},
		{"id":"edge-09","fromNode":"vol-008","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-010","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"解释为何检查平方自相关"},
		{"id":"edge-10","fromNode":"vol-009","fromSide":"left","toNode":"vol-010","toSide":"right","toEnd":"arrow","label":"辅助回归与联合相关是不同诊断"},
		{"id":"edge-12","fromNode":"vol-011","fromSide":"left","toNode":"vol-012","toSide":"right","toEnd":"arrow","label":"Gaussian 目标可作准似然"},
		{"id":"edge-13","fromNode":"vol-011","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-013","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"厚尾密度改变似然与尺度"},
		{"id":"edge-14","fromNode":"vol-013","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-014","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"分布假设也需尾部检查"},
		{"id":"edge-15","fromNode":"vol-014","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-015","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"诊断合格的候选才参与选择"},
		{"id":"edge-17","fromNode":"vol-016","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-017","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"以一步状态为起点向前迭代"},
		{"id":"edge-18","fromNode":"vol-017","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-018","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"α+β=1 改变远期边界"},
		{"id":"edge-19","fromNode":"vol-018","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-019","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"近边界估计先排查结构变化"},
		{"id":"edge-20","fromNode":"vol-020","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-021","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"用符号项刻画统计不对称"},
		{"id":"edge-21","fromNode":"vol-021","fromSide":"right","toNode":"vol-026","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"跨来源时先辨公式尺度"}
	]
}
